// Indian market results headlines -> one structured record each. Project 1a.
// ticker is the NSE symbol, never a name: one canonical key per company, so INFY is INFY
// whether the headline said Infosys or Infy, and there is no Sun Pharma / Sun Pharmaceutical
// Industries argument to have. change_pct is null unless the headline states an explicit
// percentage CHANGE: a level ("margin to 3.6% from 3.4%"), a basis-point move and "doubles"
// are all null. Labels are floats (12.0, not 12) because field_match compares text, and
// str(12) != str(12.0). See evals/README.md.

